<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)" content="oklch(99.00% 0.0012 250.00)"><meta name="theme-color" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)" content="oklch(16.00% 0.0012 250.00)"><title>Seeded themes — stucco gallery</title><script>try {
  const t = localStorage.getItem("stucco-theme");
  if (t === "light" || t === "dark") document.documentElement.dataset.theme = t;
} catch (_) {}
</script><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_stucco/stucco.HASH.css"></head><body><a class="st-skip-link" href="#main">Skip to main content</a><main id="main"><div class="st-container g-page" data-size="xl"><div class="st-stack" data-space="10"><div class="st-stack" data-space="3"><a class="st-link" href="index.html">← Gallery</a><h1 class="st-heading" data-size="3xl">Seeded themes</h1><p class="st-text" data-size="lg" data-tone="muted">Theme::seeded(n) derives colours, fonts, scale, radius, density and a style personality from one number. The same seed always gives the same theme.</p></div><section><div class="st-stack" data-space="4"><h2 class="st-heading" data-size="2xl">Theme::seeded(1)</h2><div class="g-panels" data-st-theme="seed-1"><div class="g-panel" data-theme="light"><div class="st-app-header g-sample-header"><h3 class="st-heading" data-size="lg">Light</h3></div><div class="st-stack" data-space="4"><div class="st-stack" data-space="1"><p class="st-text">Body text in the theme's sans stack, with <a class="st-link" href="#">a link</a>.</p><p class="st-text" data-size="md" data-tone="muted">Muted text for hints and captions.</p></div><div class="st-cluster" data-space="2"><button class="st-button" type="button" data-variant="primary" data-size="md">Save changes</button><button class="st-button" type="button" data-variant="secondary" data-size="md">Cancel</button><button class="st-button" type="button" data-variant="danger" data-size="md">Delete</button></div><div class="st-grid" data-min="xs" data-space="3"><div class="st-field"><label class="st-label" for="field-1">Name</label><input id="field-1" class="st-input" type="text" name="name" value="Ada Lovelace"></div><div class="st-field"><label class="st-label" for="field-2">Email</label><input id="field-2" class="st-input" type="email" name="email" value="ada@example" aria-describedby="field-2-error" aria-invalid="true"><p id="field-2-error" class="st-field-error"><span class="st-sr-only">Error: </span>Enter a val